      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User Behaviour = aggregated query\u00d7product engagement scores from clickstream (CLICK, CART, ORDER).\nBatch Spark aggregation \u2192 Redis \u2192 Mimir lookup at search time.\nNOT an online reranker ML model. NOT the same as Olympus personalization / IQ Recs (different data path).",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "User Behaviour = aggregated query\u00d7product engagement scores from clickstream (CLICK, CART, ORDER).\nBatch Spark aggregation \u2192 Redis \u2192 Mimir lookup at search time.\nNOT an online reranker ML model. NOT the same as Olympus personalization / IQ Recs (different data path).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
