      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Clickstream input (S3):\n\u2022 Paths: CLICKSTREAM_SITE_BASE_PATH / regional bucket\n\u2022 Events: CLICK, CART, ORDER; SEARCH/BROWSE for weights\n\u2022 Decay: exp(-age/duration_days)\n\u2022 Default weights e.g. click:1 cart:10 order:30 (pipeline args)\n\u2022 Ruleset search \u2192 group by query\n\u2022 Ruleset browse \u2192 group by category/node",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "GbsvTi7C55oC",
      "originalText": "Clickstream input (S3):\n\u2022 Paths: CLICKSTREAM_SITE_BASE_PATH / regional bucket\n\u2022 Events: CLICK, CART, ORDER; SEARCH/BROWSE for weights\n\u2022 Decay: exp(-age/duration_days)\n\u2022 Default weights e.g. click:1 cart:10 order:30 (pipeline args)\n\u2022 Ruleset search \u2192 group by query\n\u2022 Ruleset browse \u2192 group by category/node",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
